# Labcorp (Laboratory Corporation of America)

> Labcorp is a global leader in life sciences, CRO(Clinical research organization) and comprehensive laboratory services, delivering vital diagnostic insights and drug development solutions to patients, healthcare providers, health systems and biopharmaceutical organizations.
